{"id":"adf027c4fe144150","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-left-ce-arithmetic.md","title":"Arithmetic Closure of Left-c.e. Reals","display":"thm-left-ce-arithmetic — Arithmetic Closure of Left-c.e. Reals","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-left-ce-arithmetic","aliases":["43-thm-left-ce-arithmetic"],"display":"thm-left-ce-arithmetic — Arithmetic Closure of Left-c.e. Reals","depends_on":["[[43-df-leftcomputable]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"§8.1, increasing rational approximations","source_printed_pages":"134","source_pdf_pages":"154","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-left-ce-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-left-ce-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-left-ce-arithmetic — Arithmetic Closure of Left-c.e. Reals"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§8.1, increasing rational approximations"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"134"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"154"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\">\\(q\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\beta)\\to\\left(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha+\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(q\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\min\\{\\alpha,\\beta\\})\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\max\\{\\alpha,\\beta\\})\\land\\left(\\alpha\\ge0\\land\\beta\\ge0\\to\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha\\beta)\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\beta)\\to\\left(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha+\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(q\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\min\\{\\alpha,\\beta\\})\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\max\\{\\alpha,\\beta\\})\\land\\left(\\alpha\\ge0\\land\\beta\\ge0\\to\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha\\beta)\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将单调近似逐点相加、乘非负有理数、取最小/最大值；乘法情形先把非负实数近似截断到非负数。所有操作保留有效单调收敛。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，§8.1, increasing rational approximations；印刷页 134，PDF 页 154。本次逐项核对陈述；下文给出笔记内论证，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-leftcomputable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R$，$q\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}$；$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$ 见 [[43-df-leftcomputable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\beta)\\to\\left(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha+\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(q\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\min\\{\\alpha,\\beta\\})\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\max\\{\\alpha,\\beta\\})\\land\\left(\\alpha\\ge0\\land\\beta\\ge0\\to\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha\\beta)\\right)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1567,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-149","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-left-ce-arithmetic]] — Arithmetic Closure of Left-c.e. Reals"},{"id":"88898ebf913a1fd0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathbb R$ 均满足 $\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$；$\\le_S$ 采用 [[43-df-solovay-red]]，差分刻画见 [[43-thm-solovay-difference]]，左 c.e. 加法闭包见 [[43-thm-left-ce-arithmetic]]。"}],"outgoing":["e7d00f16a112ff92"]}